  <div class="page-header">
    <h1>About TheSouthShoreLine.com</h1>
  </div>

  <p>TheSouthShoreLine.com is a hyperlocal events calendar for Duxbury, Marshfield, Kingston, and Pembroke, MA &mdash; built to be a genuinely useful, clean, no-clutter alternative to noisy Facebook groups and generic aggregators that don't know this area.</p>

  <p>Every event is submitted directly by local businesses and organizers and reviewed by hand before it goes live. No scraping, no stale listings, no clutter.</p>

  <h2>Our Founding Sponsor</h2>
  <p><a href="{{ site.sponsor.url }}">{{ site.sponsor.name }}</a> is our founding sponsor &mdash; a Duxbury flower shop that believed in a genuinely neutral community resource before anyone else did. This site exists to be useful to the whole community first; {{ site.sponsor.name }}'s support just made it possible to build.</p>

  <h2>Submitting an Event</h2>
  <p>Own a business or run an event on the South Shore? <a href="/submit/">Submit it here</a> &mdash; it's free, and every submission is reviewed before it's published.</p>

  <p>Questions? Reach us at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
